        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the employee is unavoidably exposed to the elements due to an accident occurring while covered under this Plan, and as a result of such exposure suffers a loss for which a benefit is otherwise payable, the loss will be covered under the terms of this Plan.",
            "block_bbox": [
