        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the employee's body has not been found within one (1) year of the disappearance, forced landing, stranding, sinking, or wrecking of a vehicle in which he or she was an occupant while covered under this Plan, the loss will be covered as an accidental death under the terms of the Plan.",
