        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In designated locations, the Company provides employees with a choice among medical plans. The Traditional Medical Plan is a PPO plan that offers enhanced benefits when a member of its provider network is used. Coordinated care plans and health maintenance organizations (HMOs) also rely on selected networks of providers. Benefits are subject to all provisions of the selected plan, including medical review requirements, maximum benefits, coordination of benefits, exclusions, and definitions. If a coordinated care plan or HMO plan does not offer the negotiated plan design, the Company will substitute the closest available plan design.",
